Always read all files from /docs before making decisions.

PRISMA is NOT an RTS.

PRISMA is NOT a city builder.

PRISMA is NOT a military shooter.

Player never controls units directly.

The game is about:

- intelligence
- uncertainty
- planning
- operations
- diplomacy

Always follow architecture.md.

Always follow game-systems.md.

Never invent mechanics that contradict documentation.

Generate production-ready code only.

Use TypeScript.

Use FastAPI.

Use SQLite.

Use feature-based architecture.

Run locally only. Never add Docker, Docker Compose, Kubernetes, Redis, PostgreSQL, or Celery.

Never refactor unrelated modules.

Never modify files outside requested scope.
